<fw type="sig" place="bottom">5*</fw><lb/>
<pb n="68" facs="#f0074"/>
<sp who="#LOT"><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Loth</hi>.</speaker> <p>Mein Ehrenwort, Hoffmann! Ich hatte<lb/>
