<sp who="#JUN"><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Der Junge</hi></speaker> <p><stage>(wei&#x017F;t es ab).</stage> Behaal' Den'n Biema!</p></sp><lb/>
<sp who="#MRI"><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Marie</hi>.</speaker> <p>Ae! tumme Dare!</p></sp><lb/>
<sp who="#JUN"><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Der Junge</hi>.</speaker> <p>Na, wegen menner. <stage>(Er nimmt das Geld<lb/>
