<sp who="#AUG"><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Augu&#x017F;te</hi>.</speaker> <p>Oh jechtich! nee ok nee! bei Leibe nich!</p></sp><lb/>
<sp who="#LIE"><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Lie&#x017F;e</hi>.</speaker> <p>A &#x017F;u a oarm Weib miit achta.</p></sp><lb/>
