<sp who="#LOT"><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Loth</hi>.</speaker> <p>Deshalb mein&#x017F;t Du....</p></sp><lb/>
<sp who="#HEL"><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Helene</hi>.</speaker> <p>Ich bin majorenn, Vater muß mir's<lb/>
