<sp who="#LOT"><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Loth</hi>.</speaker> <p>Was?</p></sp><lb/>
<sp who="#HEL"><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Helene</hi>.</speaker> <p>&#x201E;Ich hab Dich</p></sp><lb/>
<sp who="#LOT"><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Loth</hi>.</speaker> <p>&#x201E;Ich hab Dich</p></sp><lb/>
<sp who="#HEL"><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Helene</hi>.</speaker> <p>&#x201E;und nur immer Dich</p></sp><lb/>
<sp who="#LOT"><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Loth</hi>.</speaker> <p>&#x201E;und nur immer Dich</p></sp><lb/>
<sp who="#HEL"><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Helene</hi>.</speaker> <p>&#x201E;geliebt &#x2014; geliebt Zeit meines Lebens</p></sp><lb/>
<sp who="#LOT"><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Loth</hi>.</speaker> <p>&#x201E;geliebt &#x2014; geliebt Zeit meines Lebens</p></sp><lb/>
<sp who="#HEL"><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Helene</hi>.</speaker> <p>&#x201E;und werde nur Dich allein Zeit meines<lb/>
Lebens lieben</p></sp><lb/>
<sp who="#LOT"><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Loth</hi>.</speaker> <p>&#x201E;und werde nur Dich allein Zeit meines<lb/>
Lebens lieben, und das i&#x017F;t wahr, &#x017F;o wahr ich ein ehr-<lb/>
