<sp who="#HEL"><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Helene</hi></speaker> <p><stage>(freudig).</stage> Das hab ich nicht ge&#x017F;agt.</p></sp><lb/>
<sp who="#LOT"><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Loth</hi>.</speaker> <p>Aber ich.<stage>(Kü&#x017F;&#x017F;e.)</stage>.........<lb/>
..................</p></sp><lb/>
<sp who="#HEL"><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Helene</hi></speaker> <p><stage>(&#x017F;ummt ganz lei&#x017F;e).</stage> Du, Du lieg&#x017F;t mir im Her&#x2014;zen<lb/>
..................</p></sp><lb/>
<sp who="#LOT"><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Loth</hi>.</speaker> <p>Jetzt &#x017F;oll&#x017F;t Du auch beichten.</p></sp><lb/>
<sp who="#HEL"><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Helene</hi>.</speaker> <p>Alles, was Du will&#x017F;t.</p></sp><lb/>
<sp who="#LOT"><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Loth</hi>.</speaker> <p>Beichte! Bin ich der Er&#x017F;te?</p></sp><lb/>
<sp who="#HEL"><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Helene</hi>.</speaker> <p>Nein.</p></sp><lb/>
<sp who="#LOT"><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Loth</hi>.</speaker> <p>Wer?</p></sp><lb/>
<sp who="#HEL"><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Helene</hi></speaker> <p><stage>(übermüthig herauslachend).</stage> Koahl-Willem!</p></sp><lb/>
<sp who="#LOT"><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Loth</hi></speaker> <p><stage>(lachend).</stage> Wer noch?</p></sp><lb/>
<pb n="83" facs="#f0089"/>
<sp who="#HEL"><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Helene</hi>.</speaker> <p>Ach nein! weiter i&#x017F;t es wirklich Keiner.<lb/>
Du mußt mir glauben..........<lb/>
