<sp who="#LOT"><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Loth</hi>.</speaker> <p>Al&#x017F;o doch noch Jemand?</p></sp><lb/>
<sp who="#HEL"><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Helene</hi></speaker> <p><stage>(heftig).</stage> Bitte, bitte, bitte, bitte, frag mich<lb/>
